Current Dev Position: YP 2.6 M3.

Next Deadline: YP 2.6 M2 Release Target is July 27, 2018


SWAT Team Rotation:

=B7         SWAT lead is currently: Amanda

=B7         SWAT team rotation: Amanda -> Tracy on July 27, 2018

=B7         SWAT team rotation: Tracy -> Armin on Aug. 3, 2018

=B7         https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_Build_Failure_Swat_Tea=
m


Key Status/Updates:

=B7         YP 2.6 M2 is in QA. See https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/2.6_=
QA_Status.  It is 84% complete.

=B7         YP 2.3.4 has been released.  This is the final release of the Y=
P 2.3 (pyro) series.

=B7         YP 2.2.4 is out of QA and will release this week. This will be =
the final release of the YP 2.2 (morty) series.

=B7         A new version of uninative-tarball will be released this week t=
o fix issues sharing sstate from newer distros.

=B7         Oe-selftest patches have merged however there are race issues i=
n the test cases, particularly where the modify metadata as part of the tes=
t. This has meant we=92ve not enabled parallelisation by default yet.

=B7         RP is compiling a list of broken selftests so we can figure out=
 fixing them by monitoring the repository for changes as the tests run. If =
anyone is interested in helping let us know! Faster oe-selftest times mean =
faster patch testing and merging.

=B7         We lack a good mechanism for flagging work which someone new to=
 the project who wants to help could take on. Richard posted one such task =
onto the OE-Core mailing list last week (=93OE-core] Request for help - Sim=
ple cleanup/optimisation task=94)

=B7         Master now has significant parallelism improvements for do_pack=
age which take the wall clock time for ltp from 605s to 163s. Some of that =
was through parallel execution of tasks, removal of the use of subprocess s=
hells also helped.


Planned Releases for YP 2.6:

=B7         YP 2.6 M2 Build ia in QA.

=B7         YP 2.6 M2 Release Target is July 27, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M3 Build Target is Aug. 27, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M3 Release Target is Sept. 7, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M4 Build Target is Oct. 1, 2018

=B7         YP 2.6 M4 Release Target is Oct. 26, 2018


Planned upcoming dot releases:

=B7         YP 2.5.1 (Sumo) will be targeted after YP 2.6 M2 is done.

=B7         YP 2.4.4 (Rocko) will be targeted after YP 2.6 M4 is done.


Tracking Metrics:

